{
  "summary": "Review of version-code bump from offset 10 to 20. To achieve ARM801003722 and x64801003728, the `roadium_version_code_offset` in `build/roadium/baseline.json` must be updated to 20. This change is purely metadata-driven and uses the existing `version_code.py` logic to calculate the new codes based on the pinned Chromium version. No architectural or source code changes are required.",
  "architecture_observations": [
    "Version code derivation is centralized in `tools/roadium/version_code.py` using `baseline.json` as the source of truth.",
    "The offset is applied to the base Chromium version code generated via `android_chrome_version.GenerateVersionCodes`.",
    "Build orchestration via `prepare-build.sh` and `compile.sh` automatically consumes the offset via the Python script.",
    "Verification via `verify-artifacts.py` strictly enforces that the generated APK/AAB version codes match the expected offset-calculated value."
  ],
  "proposed_changes": [
    {
      "file": "build/roadium/baseline.json",
      "change": "Update 'roadium_version_code_offset' from 10 to 20."
    }
  ],
  "patch": "--- a/build/roadium/baseline.json\n+++ b/build/roadium/baseline.json\n@@ -38,4 +38,4 @@\n     }\n   ],\n-  \"roadium_version_code_offset\": 10\n+  \"roadium_version_code_offset\": 20\n }",
  "risks": [
    "Incorrect offset value would cause `verify-artifacts.py` to fail during the release gate check.",
    "Manual intervention is required to update the JSON; automation is not present for this specific metadata bump."
  ],
  "tests": [
    "Run `python3 tools/roadium/version_code.py <src> build/roadium/baseline.json arm64` to verify output is 801003722.",
    "Run `python3 tools/roadium/version_code.py <src> build/roadium/baseline.json x64` to verify output is 801003728.",
    "Execute `./tools/roadium/prepare-build.sh` and check `gn args` output for `android_override_version_code`.",
    "Run `./tools/roadium/verify-artifacts.py --arch arm64` after build to ensure manifest validation passes."
  ]
}
